  "summary_en": "Kenyan Legal Notice 76 of 2019 under the Civil Aviation Act, imposing a blanket prohibition on flying unmanned aircraft in Kenya, including territorial waters, except unmanned State aircraft. Contravention is punishable by a fine up to KES 100,000 or up to 12 months' imprisonment. It lapses when the UAS Regulations commence.",
